WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:05.910
SPEAKER: What makes
something last a long time?

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:11.150
Can it last if its mission
changes along the way?

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.660
Or would that make it
something different altogether?

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:21.650
A thing only lasts when its
original purposes remain

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:29.330
intact, steadfast, unwavering.

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:32.870
175 years ago,
Hillsdale College was

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:37.970
founded with a mission defined
by four enduring purposes--

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:43.610
learning, character,
faith, and freedom--

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:48.250
the same timeless mission
that guides its work today.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:53.340
Hillsdale College-- pursuing
truth and defending liberty

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:55.530
since 1844.

